      "message": "SHA-1 is insecure and not allowed by the CDD.  You need to be using SHA-256, and you almost certainly are already.\n\nAnd the previous CL enabled SHA-256 acceleration, which was missing.\n\nIf you\u0027re somehow still using SHA-1, that would be a bug that would need to be fixed.",
