      "writtenOn": "2025-01-23T01:30:20Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "Thank you! And no, we don\u0027t need IPsec support.\n\n\u003e Probably it doesn\u0027t even need networking support? Disabling all (or at least most of) the networking support would provide a large savings too.\n\nCorrect, it doesn\u0027t need networking (TCP/IP). I actually tried to remove it (b/231106934 and some others), but couldn\u0027t. I don\u0027t remember correctly why.\n\n\u003e It would be a good idea to enforce that, like is already done for gki_defconfig.\n\nI didn\u0027t know about savedefconfig. Yeah, definitely.",
